{"unit_id":"tag:04LW:proof","translation":"由于这略有混淆，我们仔细论证。设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>-同构（isomorphism）。考虑任意开集（open）<MATH_0003>。注意，<MATH_0004>为终（final）层（sheaf）<MATH_0005>的子层（subsheaf）。因此<MATH_0006>及<MATH_0007>均为终（final）层（sheaf）的子层（subsheaves）。所以，同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0008>\n必为恒等（identity），并且<MATH_0009>。从而<MATH_0010>及<MATH_0011>在底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）上相等。接下来，取截面（section）<MATH_0012>。它确定且被确定于集合（sets）的层（sheaves）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0013>\n。将其拉回（Pull this back），再应用<MATH_0014>，得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0015>\n，其中三角形（triangle）交换（commutative），由<MATH_0016>-同构（isomorphism）的定义如此，该定义见景上的模（Modules on Sites）第<REF_0001>节。上面已看到，顶端水平（horizontal）箭头（arrows）的复合（composition）来自恒等（identity）<MATH_0017>。因此，图（diagram）的交换性（commutativity）告诉我们，<MATH_0018>在<MATH_0019>中成立。由于这对每个开集（open）<MATH_0020>及每个<MATH_0021>都成立，得到<MATH_0022>作为概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"final","target_term":"终"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"final","target_term":"终"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"subsheaves","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Pull this back","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"triangle","target_term":"三角形"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"composition","tar